Subject: Hex builds on kiln's Shards and hyper-raft
Why: kiln holds one copy of each project (docs/vendoring.md), and Hex pins an older hyper-raft (0856e05) with changes of its own. Its pin moves to kiln's (fb74b595), and its records of hyper-raft's changes are kiln's (Hex's suite reading among them, kiln's 0005; its qlog and buffer-growth changes left for Hex and kiln to agree). Its Shards pin is kiln's own (e82b9403) since Hex's steps 4 and 12 (daa36e99), which took Shards' API there too, so this change's Shards part dropped out as upstream's own (kiln plan 01a1cd8e862e7169a074db3d5fa33f3d, step 16).

